If you distribute a modified version of this software, replace the contents
of this directory with your own branding. The build works without it: every
file here overrides a same-named file in `resources/`, and nothing in the
code requires a file that exists only here except `images/Favicon.svg`.
Without `fonts/darkstar-pixel.woff2`, text set in the pixel font falls back
to Tektur.
